target        : h4
payload       : our image verbatim, park at 0x80000, code0 branch there, text_offset 0x80000
code0         : +0x80000
expected      : park, entry exactly at base+text_offset
proves        : the ABL enters at base+text_offset (0x8000+0x80000) rather than at the image base, so code that assumes base+0 is 0x80000 away from where it runs
if refused    : if refused while H3 parks: text_offset 0x80000 vs the branch target is the variable -> F1 with the same park position
os_version    : 0x1c000185 (stock)
partition     : 100663296 B
flash         : boot_b, restore_image backup/64f70df8/boot_b.img between runs
measure       : tooling/50-boot-timing.sh, plateau vs the stock control
